    "detailed_description": "EC Games Commemorative First Game &quot;Tomato Flip<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFor Video Creators and Streamers<br />\r\nEC Games is allowing monetization through our partner program using EC Games games.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTake control of a tomato and run through various stages!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Description<br />\r\nYou control a tomato and perform actions such as moving and jumping.<br />\r\nThe game is cleared when the tomato jumps into the pots and pans in the stages.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features<br />\r\nThere are 5 stages in the game, each with a different world view.<br />\r\nAfter selecting a stage, you can choose between &quot;Easy Mode&quot; with checkpoints and &quot;Normal Mode&quot; without checkpoints, allowing even beginners to play athletic games with ease.<br />\r\nThere are three hidden coins in the stage, which can be collected to unlock the stage.<br />\r\nClear time is also measured in the game, so please try again and again to set a new record!",
    "about_the_game": "EC Games Commemorative First Game &quot;Tomato Flip<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFor Video Creators and Streamers<br />\r\nEC Games is allowing monetization through our partner program using EC Games games.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTake control of a tomato and run through various stages!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Description<br />\r\nYou control a tomato and perform actions such as moving and jumping.<br />\r\nThe game is cleared when the tomato jumps into the pots and pans in the stages.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features<br />\r\nThere are 5 stages in the game, each with a different world view.<br />\r\nAfter selecting a stage, you can choose between &quot;Easy Mode&quot; with checkpoints and &quot;Normal Mode&quot; without checkpoints, allowing even beginners to play athletic games with ease.<br />\r\nThere are three hidden coins in the stage, which can be collected to unlock the stage.<br />\r\nClear time is also measured in the game, so please try again and again to set a new record!",
    "short_description": "An athletic game in which you control a tomato to reach the goal pot! Run through to clear all the stages!",
